# The normal field jumps by the permittivity ratio at each wall, so the quasi-TE mode peaks inside the low-index slot.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy.
title Slot waveguide: two 220 x 220 nm rails, 100 nm slot
grid dx=0.01 dy=0.02
window width=3.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
rect si 0.05 0.27 0 0.22
rect si -0.27 -0.05 0 0.22
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 1.836997358 2e-8
expect group_index 3.076635756 2e-6
expect confinement 0.162556559 1e-6
expect area 0.139742517 1e-5
expect guided yes
expect cells 16650
